WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:05.480
YieldShield gives holders two exit choices:
keep the remaining asset, or surrender it

2
00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:10.490
for eligible backing. This is the working
application on Monad testnet.

3
00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:13.650
All tokens shown have no monetary value.

4
00:00:14.630 --> 00:00:17.670
This walkthrough uses the clearly labeled
scenario pool.

5
00:00:18.650 --> 00:00:22.690
Its price follows a synthetic cycle, not the
live MON market.

6
00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:27.670
The reference pools stay disabled when their
upstream price feed is stale.

7
00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:31.890
We connect through Dynamic with an existing
MetaMask wallet.

8
00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:37.860
After obtaining scenario tokens from the
faucet, we choose sMON-demo with

9
00:00:37.870 --> 00:00:40.950
TestUSDC backing and enter one token.

10
00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:46.250
Before signing, the form shows the backing,
fees and waiting period.

11
00:00:47.290 --> 00:00:49.270
The deposit is confirmed on Monad.

12
00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:53.070
Positions displays the receipt and its two
exits.

13
00:00:53.930 --> 00:00:57.990
Withdrawing the asset returns the remaining
token after applicable gain-sharing fees.

14
00:00:58.970 --> 00:01:04.220
Using backing surrenders that asset, with a
payout limited by the pool's recorded cap

15
00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:09.150
and conditions. These are alternatives, not
two payments from one receipt.

16
00:01:10.150 --> 00:01:12.270
We also complete a partial asset withdrawal.

17
00:01:13.250 --> 00:01:17.170
The original receipt is replaced by a new
receipt for the remaining position.

18
00:01:18.190 --> 00:01:23.820
The preview shows the requested amount before
signing; the confirmed receipt then

19
00:01:23.830 --> 00:01:28.810
shows what remains. Backing providers supply
capital and absorb first losses.

20
00:01:29.530 --> 00:01:31.470
They receive a share of realized gains.

21
00:01:32.590 --> 00:01:38.180
A withdrawal notice permits only available
excess backing to leave; it does not unlock

22
00:01:38.190 --> 00:01:39.870
capital reserved for holders.

23
00:01:40.770 --> 00:01:43.610
Network status exposes contract and price
checks.

24
00:01:44.590 --> 00:01:49.220
The public repository includes transaction
evidence and our reuse disclosure.

25
00:01:49.230 --> 00:01:53.410
YieldShield's protocol foundation predates
Metropolis.

26
00:01:54.510 --> 00:01:57.970
This application and its Monad integrations
are the new milestone.
